// # WebAssembly Bytecode Opcodes & Section IDs
//
// Logline: WebAssembly 1.0 binary opcode and section ID definitions for stack-based code generation.
//
// Setup: Pure numerical constants adhering to WebAssembly 1.0 binary specification.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Define binary section identifiers.
//   2. Define control flow, variable, and memory access opcodes.
//   3. Define typed arithmetic, bitwise, and comparison opcodes.
//   4. Define type conversion and truncation opcodes.

